---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About roammate — The Travel Companion App"
  description="roammate was built to make solo travel more social, affordable, and safe — connecting like-minded travelers in real time so the best moments don't happen by accident."
>

  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "About roammate",
      "url": "https://roammate.com/about/",
      "description": "roammate was built to make solo travel more social, affordable, and safe — connecting like-minded travelers in real time.",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "roammate",
        "url": "https://roammate.com/",
        "logo": "https://roammate.com/images/rm-full.svg"
      }
    })} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://roammate.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://roammate.com/about/" }
      ]
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-hero-bg">
      <img
        src="/images/hero-travelers-on-bus.webp"
        srcset="/images/hero-travelers-on-bus-720w.webp 720w, /images/hero-travelers-on-bus.webp 1440w"
        sizes="100vw"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="1440"
        height="810"
        fetchpriority="high"
      >
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero-content">
      <div class="about-hero-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>About</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero-logo-wrap">
        <img src="/images/rm-notext-cropped.svg" alt="roammate logo mark" class="about-hero-logo" width="72" height="72" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="about-hero-title">
        We built roammate because solo travel<br />
        shouldn't mean traveling <em>alone</em>.
      </h1>
      <p class="about-hero-subtitle">
        The best moments on the road happen when strangers become companions.<br class="break-desktop" />
        We made that intentional.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero-scroll">
      <span>Our story</span>
      <div class="about-scroll-line"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stat Bar -->
  <div class="about-stat-bar reveal">
    <div class="about-stat-bar-inner">
      <div class="about-stat">
        <span class="about-stat-number">50+</span>
        <span class="about-stat-label">Countries</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-divider"></div>
      <div class="about-stat">
        <span class="about-stat-number">1</span>
        <span class="about-stat-label">Mission</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-divider"></div>
      <div class="about-stat">
        <span class="about-stat-number">iOS</span>
        <span class="about-stat-label">Live Now</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Story -->
  <section class="about-section about-section--story reveal">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-text">
        <div class="section-label">Our Origin</div>
        <h2 class="about-section-heading">The <em>story</em></h2>
        <p class="about-section-body">
          It started with a girl teaching English in Chai Nat. Small town, central Thailand — the kind of place
          that doesn't make the backpacker trail. She wanted to take the slow boat to Laos. Two days down the
          Mekong, the kind of trip that needs company. But she was going alone.
        </p>
        <p class="about-section-body">
          So she put the word out. Looking for other travelers heading the same way.
        </p>
        <p class="about-section-body">
          That search eventually led her to Singapore. We met there. A few years later, we married. We have three kids now —
          and still convinced the best things that happen while traveling involve other people, and that too much
          of it still depends on luck, timing, and whoever happens to be around.
        </p>
        <p class="about-section-body">
          That's the gap roammate closes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-phone-scene">
        <img src="/images/app-phone-profile.webp" alt="roammate app showing a traveler profile on an iPhone" class="story-phone-iso" width="984" height="1332" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Mission -->
  <section class="about-section about-section--alt reveal">
    <div class="about-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Why We Exist</div>
      <h2 class="about-section-heading">The <em>mission</em></h2>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        Solo travel is one of the most transformative things a person can do. It forces you out of comfort zones,
        builds confidence, and exposes you to perspectives that reshape how you see the world. But it shouldn't
        require you to be alone the whole time.
      </p>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        Our mission is to make travel more social, more affordable, and safer — by connecting like-minded travelers
        in real time. Not curated group tours. Not a dating app with a passport filter. A genuine tool for people
        who want to share a meal, split a taxi, find a hiking partner, or simply not eat alone on their birthday
        in a foreign city.
      </p>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        We believe the best travel stories involve other people. We're building the infrastructure for those stories
        to happen more often.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We're Building -->
  <section class="about-section reveal">
    <div class="about-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The Product</div>
      <h2 class="about-section-heading">What we're <em>building</em></h2>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        roammate is a travel companion app — designed from the ground up for the way younger travelers actually move.
        Here's what's coming:
      </p>
      <ul class="about-feature-list">
        <li class="about-feature reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="about-feature-icon">&#9632;</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Real-time traveler discovery</h3>
            <p>See who else is in your city, hostel, or region right now. Filter by travel style, language, and interests — not just proximity.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="about-feature reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="about-feature-icon">&#9632;</div>
          <div>
            <h3>In-app messaging</h3>
            <p>Reach out, coordinate, and make plans without handing over your phone number to someone you just met.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="about-feature reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="about-feature-icon">&#9632;</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Cost splitting</h3>
            <p>Taxis, day trips, accommodation, food runs — split costs with travel companions simply and transparently, no awkward IOUs.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="about-feature reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="about-feature-icon">&#9632;</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Verified profiles</h3>
            <p>Travel with confidence. Profile verification and traveler reviews mean you know who you're meeting before you meet them.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="about-section-body about-section-body--spaced">
        The app is in development. We're building it carefully — because the people who will use it are trusting us
        with their safety in unfamiliar places.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Team -->
  <section class="about-section about-section--alt reveal">
    <div class="about-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The People</div>
      <h2 class="about-section-heading">The <em>team</em></h2>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        We're a small team — a handful of people who between us have traveled through more than fifty countries,
        slept in dorm beds and overnight buses, eaten street food that turned out to be extraordinary and some
        that definitely wasn't, found love and a soulmate, and accumulated a lot of opinions about what solo travel actually needs.
      </p>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        We're building from experience, not assumption. Every feature we design, we've wished existed when we
        were out there ourselves. We know what it's like to feel isolated in a crowd, and we know what it's like
        to meet one person who changes the whole shape of a trip.
      </p>
      <p class="about-section-body">
        We're remote-first, passport-obsessed, and deeply allergic to building something generic.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="about-cta reveal">
    <div class="about-cta-inner">
      <div class="about-cta-logo">
        <img src="/images/rm-notext-cropped.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
      <h2 class="about-cta-heading">Download roammate <em>now</em></h2>
      <p class="about-cta-body">
        roammate is live on iOS. Connect with fellow travelers, share experiences,
        and turn every trip into something worth remembering.
      </p>
      <div class="about-cta-badges">
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6758834253?pt=118224460&ct=about-page-cta&mt=8" class="about-cta-badge-link" aria-label="Download on App Store" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-ph-event="cta_click" data-ph-label="About CTA — App Store">
          <img src="/images/app-store-badge.png" alt="Download on App Store" class="about-cta-badge" width="564" height="189">
        </a>
        <a href="/#waitlist" class="about-cta-badge-link" aria-label="Get it on Google Play">
          <img src="/images/google-play-badge.png" alt="Get it on Google Play" class="about-cta-badge" width="564" height="168">
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ========================
     HERO
     ======================== */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }


  @keyframes logoPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.04); }
  }

  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 120px 40px 100px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0f0e0d;
  }

  .about-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .about-hero-bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 40%;
    transform: scale(1.05);
    animation: heroZoom 20s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .about-hero-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgba(10, 8, 6, 0.95) 0%,
      rgba(10, 8, 6, 0.6) 40%,
      rgba(10, 8, 6, 0.35) 70%,
      rgba(10, 8, 6, 0.5) 100%
    );
  }

  .about-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-hero-breadcrumb {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.35);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.2s forwards;
  }

  .about-hero-breadcrumb a {
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .about-hero-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .about-hero-breadcrumb span {
    margin: 0 10px;
  }

  .about-hero-logo-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 1s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .about-hero-logo {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    animation: logoPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.4));
  }

  .about-hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.5vw, 66px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px);
    animation: fadeUp 1.2s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .about-hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .about-hero-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.6);
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 1s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.9s forwards;
  }

  .break-desktop {
    display: none;
  }

  .about-hero-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 44px;
    right: 40px;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 1s var(--ease-out-expo) 1.3s forwards;
  }

  .about-hero-scroll span {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.5);
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  }

  .about-scroll-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.3);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-scroll-line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -100%;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-terracotta);
    animation: scrollLine 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* ========================
     STAT BAR
     ======================== */
  .about-stat-bar {
    background: #1a1714;
    padding: 0 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.06);
  }

  .about-stat-bar-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-stat {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 44px 20px;
    gap: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-stat-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
  }

  .about-stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.1);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  /* ========================
     CONTENT SECTIONS
     ======================== */
  .about-section {
    padding: 100px 40px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  /* ========================
     STORY SECTION
     ======================== */
  .about-section--story {
    padding: 100px 40px;
  }

  .story-grid {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story-text {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .story-phone-scene {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .story-phone-iso {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-section--alt {
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
  }

  .about-section-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-section .section-label {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .about-section-heading em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
  }

  .about-section-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-section-body:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-section-body--spaced {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  /* ========================
     FEATURE LIST
     ======================== */
  .about-feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .about-feature {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-feature-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: 7px;
    font-size: 8px;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-feature h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .about-feature p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ========================
     CTA
     ======================== */
  .about-cta {
    background: #0f0e0d;
    padding: 120px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-cta::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%, rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.18) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(232, 115, 74, 0.06) 0%, transparent 50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-cta-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-cta-logo {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .about-cta-logo img {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
  }

  .about-cta-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-cta-heading em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .about-cta-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .about-cta-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-cta-badge-link {
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo), opacity 0.3s;
  }

  .about-cta-badge-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .about-cta-badge {
    height: 56px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ========================
     RESPONSIVE
     ======================== */
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .break-desktop { display: inline; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-hero { padding: 170px 24px 80px; }
    .about-stat-bar { padding: 0 24px; }
    .about-section { padding: 80px 24px; }
    .about-section--story { padding: 80px 24px; }
    .about-cta { padding: 100px 24px; }
    .about-hero-scroll { right: 24px; }
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 60px; }
    .story-phone-iso { max-width: 360px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .story-phone-iso { max-width: 300px; }

    .about-hero {
      padding: 170px 20px 80px;
      min-height: 90vh;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .about-hero-title { font-size: clamp(30px, 9vw, 48px); }
    .about-hero-scroll { display: none; }
    .about-stat-bar { padding: 0 20px; }
    .about-stat { padding: 36px 12px; }
    .about-stat-number { font-size: 38px; }
    .about-section { padding: 64px 20px; }
    .about-cta { padding: 80px 20px; }
    .about-feature-list { gap: 28px; }
  }
</style>
